Block telemetry: this source build is not supported by Brave Software.

Nothing from it should reach Brave's analytics or crash servers. Brave Origin
branded builds already turn P3A, the usage ping and crash reporting off by
default; do the same for every build, and block them in code so that neither
the settings, a policy nor a hand-edited Local State can turn them back on:
- P3A: P3AService::IsP3AEnabled() is always false;
- usage ping: referral and SERP-metrics pings are always disallowed (the
  stats updater itself is compiled out with enable_brave_stats_updater=false);
- crash reports: no upload URL, reporting off by default;
- the corresponding settings toggles and welcome-page offers are hidden.

